abstract: >
  Derived-only analysis pack for an OCR-derived corpus from the 2nd edition
  of Zhongyi Fangji Da Cidian. This archive contains benchmark indices, evaluation
  tables, figures, provenance mappings, and public-safe scripts, but does not
  redistribute the full OCR-derived book text.
